{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29697","headline":"当句有对 · 李商隐","name":"当句有对","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密迩平阳接上兰，秦楼鸳瓦汉宫盘。\n池光不定花光乱，日气初涵露气乾。\n但觉游蜂饶舞蝶，岂知孤凤忆离鸾。\n三星自转三山远，紫府程遥碧落宽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}